  intro u η M δ fl hr hu0 hu hη0 hη hδ0 hδ1 r x xh d W X e hl hl32 hC hd ha hW hX he hT hM
  have k := ardot_core u η M δ fl hr hu0 hu hη0 hη hδ0 hδ1 r x xh d W X e hl hl32 hC hd ha hW hX
